== Overview ==
The [[Destructor Astro Toilet]] is an enemy that was added in the [[Episode 75 Update]].

It has 81,083,776 million HP.

== Appearance ==
The '''Destructor Astro toilet''' has 7 lasers, it wears a helmet, and has a black metal mask.

== Trivia ==

* It's also based off [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Destructor_Astro_Toilet?so=search Destructor Astro Toilet] from the series.

* Underneath the helmet, his face is a default smile face.

